{"products":{"80247":{"code":"80247","name":"LEGO DUPLO Classic Deluxe Brick Box 10914 Building Toy","listingStatus":"LISTEDSELLABLE","onlineDate":null,"url":null,"information":{"description":"<p>Inspire endless creative play and countless developmental benefits with the diverse and versatile LEGO DUPLO Deluxe Brick Box. Inside the sturdy toy box, you'll find inspiration and ideas to engage and excite young minds. There's a car, windows, flowers, balloons, gifts and a cake bricks labelled 1 to 5 for number play and, of course, an amazing assortment of LEGO bricks in a rainbow of cool colors. As parents and caregivers join in connecting the bricks and pieces to make imaginative models, they share precious developmental milestones with their little builders. With colorful, easy-to-hold pieces that excite imaginations and encourage open-ended play, LEGO DUPLO sets put creative control right into the hands of preschool kids.</p>","summary":"Product Features: <ul><li>Motivate young minds with this toddler-friendly mix of bricks and pieces.</li><li>Contains 85 bricks including familiar objects to stimulate imaginative play.</li><li>Combine the bricks and pieces to create endless imaginative play possibilities.</li><li>Makes a great gift for toddlers aged 18 months and up.</li><li>Mix together with other DUPLO sets for even more imaginative fun.</li><li>No batteries needed – so the hands-on play can begin straightaway.</li><li>A simple guide provides parents and toddlers with ideas and inspiration.</li><li>All LEGO® DUPLO® playsets provide endless stimulating, open-ended joy.</li><li>LEGO® DUPLO® bricks fit together and pull apart easily – perfect for toddlers!</li><li>LEGO® sets are rigorously tested to be absolutely safe for young builders.</li></ul>","specifications":[{"name":"Article Number","description":"80247"},{"name":"Brand Name","description":"LEGO"},{"name":"Product Depth","description":"18.0 cm"},{"name":"Product Height","description":"26.2 cm"},{"name":"Produc